  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Search path",
      "items": [
        "Opus 5.5 turns a question into filters + search text; cause-label chips",
        "One query: SQL filters, 2,000 nearest on a half-precision HNSW index, keyword hits",
        "Sonnet 5.5 scores the top 40, 0–100 with a reason",
        "Analysis panel from the 200 closest; Export slide builds PNG / PPTX in the browser",
        "Org page: grants received and given, FLAG, people, Pub 78 status, In the news, Similar organizations",
        "Research Buddy (Opus 5.5) cites 990 text and calls the research_answer tool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Research answers",
      "items": [
        "Regex screen, then the prompt-cached Sonnet 5.5 router writes a spec",
        "Fixed SQL on the research layer, grants, Schedule I, federal awards, 990 lines, IRS SOI household giving and finance panels; never model-written SQL",
        "Trends deflated by BLS CPI-U; national totals checked against IRS SOI and Giving USA benchmarks",
        "Who received it: recipient types (079) on grant totals and funder pages",
        "Premise check corrects false assumptions; IRS or corrected NTEE groups",
        "Buddy, /api/v1/answer and MCP call the same engine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Claude usage",
      "items": [
        "App: claude(feature) in lib/llm.ts for parse, rerank, overview, themes, router, follow-ups, Buddy and Ask about this finding",
        "One llm_usage row per Messages API call: model, feature, exact tokens; no prompt text",
        "Partner API and MCP make no Claude calls except answer?q=",
        "Cause labels run on the Claude subscription via claude -p, not the API key"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Hosting + access",
      "items": [
        "MacBook: launchd service on :4000, public URL via Tailscale Funnel",
        "SITE_PASSWORD on every page; /api/v1 and /mcp need a Bearer key instead",
        "/admin adds ADMIN_PASSWORD: health, Linux helper, data freshness, API calls, Claude tokens, nightly checks",
        "Keys: sha256 in api_keys, scopes (read, iog_internal), rate limit; every call in api_calls (90 days)",
        "Nightly pg_dump at 2:30 AM, newest 3 kept, copied to the Linux helper and restore-tested Sundays"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Data",
      "items": [
        "IRS: 1.8M orgs, 907,095 990 filings, 14.8M foundation grants (2012–2021 from the GivingTuesday data lake), 8.5M Schedule I lines",
        "Census SAIPE + ACS, USAspending (linked by UEI via the Federal Audit Clearinghouse), SEC EDGAR, BLS CPI-U, IRS SOI individual returns",
        "IRS Pub 78 and revocations, GDELT news org links, board people (4.86M seats)",
        "IoG Giving Guides: internal, iog_internal scope only",
        "Cause labels: label_causes.py on the subscription; after_load.sh tops them up",
        "Research layer: grant_cube, charity cube, histograms, rollups, cause_lookup"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Linux helper",
      "items": [
        "Embed worker writes nomic vectors straight to Postgres",
        "Ollama (Qwen2.5-7B) for the NTEE check and service areas; faiss builds similar orgs weekly",
        "Data quality 3:30 and the 150-question benchmark + home prompts 4:00 via the live API",
        "Heartbeat every minute to /admin"
      ]
    }
  ]
}